### 提交 Vendor 货件确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-shipments/confirmations/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"shipmentConfirmations":[{"shipmentIdentifier":"SHIPMENT-001","shipmentConfirmationType":"ORIGINAL","shipmentType":"TRUCK_LOAD","shipmentStructure":"PALLETIZED_LTL","sellingParty":{"partyId":"VENDOR_CODE"},"shipFromParty":{"partyId":"VENDOR_CODE"},"shipToParty":{"partyId":"AMAZON"},"shippedDate":"2026-08-08T08:00:00Z","items":[]}]}}

### 提交 Vendor 货件
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-shipments/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","body":{"shipments":[{"shipmentIdentifier":"SHIPMENT-001","shipmentType":"TRUCK_LOAD","shipmentStructure":"PALLETIZED_LTL","sellingParty":{"partyId":"VENDOR_CODE"},"shipFromParty":{"partyId":"VENDOR_CODE"},"shipToParty":{"partyId":"AMAZON"},"items":[]}]}}

### 查询 Vendor 货件详情
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-shipments/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"createdAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","limit":"20"}}

### 查询 Vendor 运输标签
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/vendor-shipments/labels/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"US","query":{"labelCreatedAfter":"2026-08-01T00:00:00Z","limit":"20"}}
